  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAPA- EADB 2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project main objective is to support the capacity development and institutional strengthening of East African Development Bank (EADB) in order to contribute to regional integration of EAC Member states and to promote more effectively the development of the private sector, particularly Small and Medium Entreprises (SMEs). Especially, it consist of strengthen EADB&#x2019;s capacity to enable it deliver its development mandate more effectively and efficiently.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s main Beneficiaries are East African Community (EAC) Member States</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR"></narrative>
  </description>
